          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku' lwandi' lwa mutemi, u'lu' ize av'ezye wu'kenagu'zi bila ku'loma, ku' ku'v'ezya ki'ntu' i'cho ki'giziv'ilwe na nhama yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wakwe, mutemi mwenu'yo alav'e na musango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alav'e wawi'lwa wu'kenagu'zi wakwe, yi'lamudime ku'leta mbu'li ngulati' i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema yi'v'e ki'taambo chakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa mbu'li yeni'yo na ku'yi'si'nzi'la aho vili'si'nzi'lagwa vitaambo vya ku'zigya ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Cheni'cho ki'li' ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' muhozya alasole magazi ga ki'taambo cheni'cho, aladobye ku' lyala lyakwe na ku'v'ila ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo. Magazi ago galasigali'le alagite ha nsi'li'li' na ihozezyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alagazigye maguta gose ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, ki'ti' i'vyo ali'gazigyaga maguta ga vitaambo vya kwiswanania. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yo muhozya alamuv'ezezye wu'swanano mutemi mwenu'yo ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wakwe, nawe alatondolwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
